
>> Size := Réad nua.
Size ar: ['is:'] déan: { :uimhir
	uimhir ar: ['+'] déan: { :uimhir
		>> unit := uimhir cáilitheoir.
		>> factor := 1.
		
		unit
		cás: ['inch'] déan: { factor := 0.0833. }. <- féin + (uimhir * factor).
	}. <- uimhir.
}.

# This size number can be used as follows:

>> plank := Size is: 6 foot.
>> edge := Size is: 50 inch.

# This will show as: 10.165
Aschur scríobh: plank + edge, líne-nua.
